  "markdown": "D57 and D58 are recorded in the existing wiki notes: v1 includes the phone-width lesson graph and the full library canvas. Your direction is to **use the canvas as a starting point and refine the design**.\n\nThe full library canvas remains in v1 despite the earlier recommendation to start with a chains list. Whether a chains list should sit alongside the canvas is still open.\n\nThe wiki rebuild and link checks passed. These are recorded design choices; no app code was implemented.\n\nThe next design spike is ready below: a synthetic comparison of a label-dense canvas and a cluster-first canvas. It uses sample lesson content and is an illustrative local preview, not verified product behavior. I recommend exploring the cluster-first variant because it gives the library an overview while revealing lesson labels for the selected group.\n\nThe phone graph layout for more than three parallel steps remains unresolved. This canvas comparison does not settle that layout or whether to retain a companion chains list.\n\nYou can choose a variant, comment on the preview, or leave general Notes without choosing. Changing the preview only changes the view; it does not select your answer.",
